          "$\\dfrac{AL}{AB} = \\dfrac{LM}{BC}$ أي $\\dfrac{2}{x} = \\dfrac{2}{4}$",
          "$x = \\dfrac{4 \\times 2}{2}$"
        ],
        "result": "x = 4"
